Open the version zero point eleven release on GitHub. Download the Windows installer
and

6
00:00:21,661 --> 00:00:26,698
the Kaggle notebook. Run the installer on your PC. If you choose the zip

7
00:00:26,698 --> 00:00:30,295
instead, extract it first. This is an unsigned development preview.

8
00:00:31,695 --> 00:00:37,857
In your Kaggle account, create a notebook and import the downloaded notebook file.
Select

9
00:00:37,857 --> 00:00:44,018
