12
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:57,281
Open Kaggle's Secrets interface, usually under Add ons. Create the secret named on
screen,

13
00:00:57,281 --> 00:01:02,103
using a unique random value of at least thirty two characters. Enable it for

14
00:01:02,103 --> 00:01:06,924
this notebook. Keep the same value securely for the desktop app. Never paste it

15
00:01:06,924 --> 00:01:09,335
into a public notebook cell or GitHub.

16
00:01:10,735 --> 00:01:15,282
Run the setup cell and enter the full legal name of the person or

17
