minutes.

20
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,793
In Gen three D, open Projection Studio and expand Online three D Studio, Hunyuan

21
00:01:34,793 --> 00:01:39,586
three D. Paste the connection URL printed by your own running notebook. Enter the

22
00:01:39,586 --> 00:01:44,379
