Do

23
00:01:44,379 --> 00:01:46,775
not use somebody else's URL or token.

24
00:01:48,175 --> 00:01:53,189
For text, choose Text description. Describe one complete object, such as a friendly
orange

25
00:01:53,189 --> 00:01:58,203
robot on a plain background. Start with thirty shape steps and seed zero, then

26
00:01:58,203 --> 00:02:03,217
choose Generate three D model. The backend first creates a reference image with S

27
00:02:03,217 --> 00:02:06,440
D X L Turbo, then builds a Hunyuan mesh.

28
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:12,666
For image input, choose Reference image, then choose a P N G or J

29
00:02:12,666 --> 00:02:17,492
peg file. Use one clearly visible subject with as little background clutter as
possible.

30
00:02:17,492 --> 00:02:22,318
The file limit is ten megabytes and sixteen megapixels. Choose Generate three D
model

31
00:02:22,318 --> 00:02:26,110
after selecting your image. Wait for the GPU job to finish.

32
00:02:27,510 --> 00:02:32,471
When a job succeeds, the model downloads into your local library. Review it in

33
00:02:32,471 --> 00:02:37,432
the preview before using it. This video uses a procedural sample robot to explain

34
00:02:37,432 --> 00:02:42,393
the controls. It is not Hunyuan output. Generating and previewing a model do not

35
00:02:42,393 --> 00:02:43,810
change your live projection.

36
00:02:45,210 --> 00:02:50,167
Choose Save G L B copy to export the model to a folder. Choose

37
00:02:50,167 --> 00:02:55,125
Use reviewed model on projection only when you are ready to show it. That

38
00:02:55,125 --> 00:03:00,082
explicit action changes projection. The sample on screen demonstrates this control.
Generated meshes are

39
00:03:00,082 --> 00:03:02,915
not automatically rigged, animated, or able to sing.

40
00:03:04,315 --> 00:03:09,461
Use Cancel if you no longer need a job. A GPU operation already running

41
00:03:09,461 --> 00:03:14,606
may finish before cancellation can discard its result. If Kaggle stops or restarts,
run

42
00:03:14,606 --> 00:03:19,752
the notebook again and reconnect using its new URL. Models already downloaded remain
on

43
00:03:19,752 --> 00:03:22,325
your PC and can be reviewed offline.

44
00:03:23,725 --> 00:03:29,516
If connection fails, check the URL, token, Internet access, and running server cell.
If

45
00:03:29,516 --> 00:03:35,307
generation fails, inspect the G P U log in Kaggle. This profile creates untextured,

46
00:03:35,307 --> 00:03:41,097
unrigged meshes. Automated app and service tests passed, but actual inference on
Kaggle hardware

47
00:03:41,097 --> 00:03:44,820
